  "面向微信、支付宝和抖音小程序，把需求摸排、开发验证与上线准备串成可核验的 Agent 工程流程。": "An Agent engineering toolkit for WeChat, Alipay, and Douyin mini programs, covering requirements discovery, development verification, and release preparation.",
  "从现有项目和平台约束出发，将需求拆成用户操作、前置条件、预期结果与异常状态，并为验收标准记录对应证据。": "Start with the existing project and platform constraints. Define user actions, prerequisites, expected outcomes, and error states, then record evidence against the acceptance criteria.",
  "按平台核对提审、发布和隐私申报要求，区分自动检查与人工确认。预览、真机验证和上线验收分别记录依据。": "Check review, release, and privacy disclosure requirements for each platform, separating automated checks from manual review. Record separate evidence for previews, on-device testing, and release acceptance.",
  "在已合并的 PR #23 中修复 Windows 下的 Agent CLI 输出解码，显式指定 UTF-8，并用中文和表情符号样例验证。": "Fixed Agent CLI output decoding on Windows in merged PR #23 by using UTF-8 explicitly. Verified the change with Chinese text and emoji.",
  "将 Java 和 Spring 工程规约按任务组织，供 Agent 在设计、实现、审查和验证时加载相关规则。": "A task-based engineering rule set for Java and Spring that gives Agents relevant guidance during design, implementation, review, and verification.",
  "为开发、设计、审查、测试、修复、重构和查规范提供独立入口，覆盖 Spring 接口的入参校验、兼容性，以及 SQL、事务和幂等。": "Provide separate entry points for implementation, design, review, testing, fixes, refactoring, and rule lookup. The rules cover Spring API input validation and compatibility, as well as SQL, transactions, and idempotency.",
  "审查代码时先核对数据正确性、权限与失败路径。对发现的问题记录代码位置、触发条件、影响和最小修复建议。": "Prioritize data correctness, authorization, and failure paths in code review. For each finding, record the code location, triggering condition, impact, and smallest practical fix.",
  "订单状态修复示例展示如何用相关测试核验行为。涉及事务、并发或旧数据的修改，可针对触发条件补充回归用例。": "An order status fix demonstrates how to verify behavior with targeted tests. For changes involving transactions, concurrency, or legacy data, add regression cases that reproduce the triggering conditions.",
  "面向已有前端项目的开源 UI 资源选型与集成，帮助 Agent 根据技术栈和交互需求制定可验证的组件方案。": "Helps Agents select and integrate open-source UI resources in an existing frontend, using the technology stack and interaction requirements to define a verifiable component strategy.",
  "先检查框架版本、路由、样式和依赖，再比较候选组件的主题适配、集成成本、包体积与维护情况，明确主选方案。": "Check framework versions, routing, styles, and dependencies first. Compare candidates on theme fit, integration effort, bundle size, and maintenance before selecting a primary approach.",
  "核对实际复用的源代码、模板和素材许可证。集成后检查不同屏幕尺寸、键盘焦点和读屏体验，并跑构建回归。": "Check the licenses of the code, templates, and assets actually reused. After integration, verify different screen sizes, keyboard focus, and screen reader behavior, then run a build regression check.",
  "公开的订单编辑案例采用 React、shadcn/ui 和 Radix，演示如何将编辑弹窗接入已有后台并核验交互与源码来源。": "The public order editing example uses React, shadcn/ui, and Radix to integrate a dialog into an existing admin interface and verify its interactions and source provenance.",
