  "以 React Native 和 Expo 搭建移动端原型，围绕人体探索、训练计划、饮食管理与个人中心规划首版功能入口。": "Uses React Native and Expo for the mobile prototype, with first-version navigation planned for anatomy exploration, training plans, diet tracking, and the personal dashboard.",
  "工程划分为移动端、Spring Boot API 和 Vue 3 管理端，分别负责用户交互、业务服务与运营配置。": "Splits the project into the mobile app, a Spring Boot API, and a Vue 3 admin interface for user interactions, business services, and operational configuration respectively.",
  "原型演示以虚构训练计划为例，梳理浏览、提交选择与个人中心回读的流程，并讨论运营模板和个人记录的归属。": "The prototype demo uses a fictional training plan to walk through browsing, submitting a selection, and retrieving it from the personal dashboard. It also explores ownership of admin-managed templates and personal records.",
  "工业缺陷智能检测与边缘推理": "Industrial Defect Detection & Edge Inference",
  "参与基于深度学习芯片的工业质检方案设计，范围从图像输入延伸到边缘推理结果输出。": "Contributed to the design of an industrial inspection pipeline for a deep learning chip, spanning image input through edge inference output.",
  "方案覆盖质检图像输入与特征处理，明确图像数据进入芯片侧推理前需要经过的准备环节。": "The design covers inspection image input and feature processing, including the stages that prepare image data for on-chip inference.",
