  "拥有 2 年全栈开发经验，以后端工程与 AI 应用开发为主。使用 Java / Spring Boot 构建业务服务，使用 Python / FastAPI 开发 AI 服务。熟悉 Kubernetes（K8s）架构设计，参与微服务拆分、数据分片与容器化交付。": "Full-stack developer with two years of experience focused on backend engineering and applied AI. Build business services with Java and Spring Boot and AI services with Python and FastAPI. Familiar with Kubernetes architecture design, with experience contributing to microservice decomposition, data sharding, and containerized delivery.",
  "参与 ToC 社区从 0 到 1 的建设，承担需求调研、方案设计与后端开发。设计并维护 300+ 个社区业务 API，覆盖设备管理、内容互动与审核。平台面向百万用户规模设计，目前注册用户已超过 10 万。": "Contributed to building a consumer community from the ground up, covering requirements research, solution design, and backend development. Designed and maintained over 300 community APIs for device management, content interactions, and moderation. The platform was designed for a target scale of one million users and now has more than 100,000 registered users.",
  "具备 AI Agent 开发经验。在语音桌宠项目中，使用 LangGraph 编排意图识别、知识检索与设备控制，并接入流式语音。在电商智能客服项目中，基于 RAG 提供商品、物流与售后问答，集成订单查询与人工工单转接。": "Developed AI agents for voice interaction and e-commerce support. Orchestrated intent recognition, knowledge retrieval, and device control with LangGraph for a voice-enabled desktop companion and integrated audio streaming. Used RAG to answer product, shipping, and after-sales questions and integrated order lookup and ticket-based escalation to human agents.",
  "具备智能硬件与物联网（IoT）、ToB 管理平台及数字孪生大屏项目经验，涉及设备接入与控制、多租户访问控制，以及设备轨迹和生产数据追溯。": "Project experience also includes smart hardware and IoT, business management platforms, and digital twin dashboards, covering device integration and control, multi-tenant access control, and equipment tracking and production traceability.",
  "具备良好的英语读写与技术沟通能力，能够阅读英文技术文档、撰写技术说明并参与技术讨论。": "Read technical documentation, write technical notes, and participate in technical discussions in English.",
  "参与 ToC 社区从 0 到 1 的建设，承担需求调研、方案设计与后端开发。设计并维护 300+ 个社区业务 API，覆盖设备管理、内容互动与审核。参与按业务域拆分服务，使用 ShardingSphere 按用户 ID 对核心数据表分片，并配合 Kubernetes 环境的 CI/CD 发布。平台面向百万用户规模设计，目前注册用户已超过 10 万。": "Contributed to building a consumer community from the ground up, covering requirements research, solution design, and backend development. Designed and maintained over 300 APIs for device management, content interactions, and moderation. Helped split services by business domain, used ShardingSphere to shard core tables by user ID, and supported Kubernetes releases through CI/CD. The platform was designed for a target scale of one million users and now has more than 100,000 registered users.",
  "具备 AI Agent 开发经验。为语音桌宠构建 LangGraph 工作流，串联意图识别、知识检索、设备工具调用与回复生成，并通过 WebSocket 传输 Opus 音频流。为电商智能客服构建商品、物流与售后知识库，通过 RAG 提供问答，集成订单查询与人工工单转接。": "Developed AI agents for voice interaction and e-commerce support. Built a LangGraph workflow for a voice-enabled desktop companion, orchestrating intent recognition, knowledge retrieval, device tool calls, and response generation. Streamed Opus audio over WebSocket. Built a product, shipping, and after-sales knowledge base for an e-commerce support agent, used RAG for Q&A, and integrated order lookup and ticket-based escalation to human agents.",
